      "description" : {
         "content" : [
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "in particular, the current regression tests call GetLength () on the Sequence_LinkedList<>. Thats quite slow. It MIGHT make sense to (optionally) cache the lenght.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "With newer C++ features (if constexpr, enable_if , [[maybezerosized__attr]] etc) - I think we can add a field OPTIONALLY for the length and conditionally use/ update it. This optioanl could be propagated to a template param in Sequence_DoublyLinkedList::CTOR, not sure exactly how. We want to select teh rep based on this. BUt the rest of the data is non-constant.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "LOWPRI.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            }
         ],
